&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Entries may be emailed to Judi A. Vining, <a href="mailto:judi.vining@aol.com">judi.vining@aol.com</a>, or sent by traditional mail to Judi A. Vining, P. O. Box 505, Yardley, PA 19067.<br><br>

